OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies following fire in flat
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man in his 60s has died following a
OL,6,Ffire at a flat in Londonderry.
OL,8,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,9,FService (NIFRS) was called to the blaze
OL,10,Fin the Bloomfield Park area of Galliagh
OL,11,Fat 15.39 BST on Wednesday.
OL,13,FAmbulance crews and police also
OL,14,Fattended and a police cordon remained
OL,15,Fin place on Thursday.
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination will take
OL,18,Fplace, police said, adding officers
OL,19,Fremain at the scene with enquiries into
OL,20,Fthe fire ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
